  "published": "2026-11-25T16:55:31.297Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.9.0: Robokassa sends the cart for receipts (SendReceipt, ReceiptTax, ReceiptPaymentMethod, ReceiptPaymentObject): one item with the plan's name and price, minimized JSON URL-encoded once inside the signature after InvId and again in the link, as Robochecks for the self-employed need. v0.8.0: Robokassa provider (AddRobokassa, \"Billing:Robokassa\"): signed payment links with Password #1, Result URL verified with Password #2 in constant time, SHA256 by default (MD5 to SHA512 supported), separate test passwords and IsTest, Shp_user and Shp_plan under the signature, amount checked against the plan, the invoice number from a host factory. The webhook endpoint answers \"OK<InvId>\" through the new IBillingWebhookReply.",
